        ]
      ],
      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "7e9239a60ec24db48ac495d81468a09999e413c6f7e2512048d466e9251a739d"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "With only sample moments in hand, deviations from normality are indicated by significant skewness and/or kurtosis. Bowman and Shenton (1975) proposed a joint test of this, employing the statistic",
      "source_page": 310,
      "printed_page": 290,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter11:p004:b3"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        123.0,
